[en_US] "Manual (default) queues nothing automatically \u2014 use the \"Translate missing\" bulk action on the Comments screen on your own schedule. Automatic queues a translation the moment a comment is approved (or arrives already-approved), which can spend API calls on comments a moderator was about to reject if there's a large held-for-moderation backlog." -> "Manual (default) queues nothing automatically \u2014 use the \"Translate missing\" bulk action on the Comments screen on your own schedule. Automatic queues a translation the moment a comment is approved (or arrives already-approved), which can spend API calls on comments a moderator was about to reject if there's a large held-for-moderation backlog."
[en_US] "Max nested-reply depth" -> "Max nested-reply depth"
[en_US] "How many levels of nested replies \"Translate missing\" will walk and translate in one pass, counting the original top-level comment as level 0. Default 2 covers the original comment plus replies and replies-to-replies. Bounds AI spend on deep threads \u2014 anything nested deeper isn't backfilled until this is raised or a further pass runs." -> "How many levels of nested replies \"Translate missing\" will walk and translate in one pass, counting the original top-level comment as level 0. Default 2 covers the original comment plus replies and replies-to-replies. Bounds AI spend on deep threads \u2014 anything nested deeper isn't backfilled until this is raised or a further pass runs."
