[sv_SE] plural slot 0: "%d pair could not be translated yet (e.g. a nested reply waiting on its parent, or a language currently in cooldown after repeated failures)." -> "%d par kunde \u00e4nnu inte \u00f6vers\u00e4ttas (t.ex. ett n\u00e4stlat svar som v\u00e4ntar p\u00e5 sin f\u00f6r\u00e4lder, eller ett spr\u00e5k som f\u00f6r n\u00e4rvarande \u00e4r i cooldown efter upprepade misslyckanden)."
[sv_SE] plural slot 1: "%d pair could not be translated yet (e.g. a nested reply waiting on its parent, or a language currently in cooldown after repeated failures)." -> "%d par kunde \u00e4nnu inte \u00f6vers\u00e4ttas (t.ex. n\u00e4stlade svar som v\u00e4ntar p\u00e5 sin f\u00f6r\u00e4lder, eller ett spr\u00e5k som f\u00f6r n\u00e4rvarande \u00e4r i cooldown efter upprepade misslyckanden)."
[sv_SE] "Comment Translation" -> "Kommentar\u00f6vers\u00e4ttning"
[sv_SE] "Mirrors an approved comment onto every language version of the post it belongs to, translated, as a real comment on each sibling page. Off by default." -> "Spegelar en godk\u00e4nd kommentar till alla spr\u00e5kversioner av inl\u00e4gget den tillh\u00f6r, \u00f6versatt, som en riktig kommentar p\u00e5 varje syskon-sida. Avst\u00e4ngd som standard."
[sv_SE] "Comment translation" -> "Kommentar\u00f6vers\u00e4ttning"
[sv_SE] "Enable comment translation" -> "Aktivera kommentar\u00f6vers\u00e4ttning"
[sv_SE] "Off by default. This feature makes AI provider requests \u2014 and spends the associated API cost \u2014 for approved comments on any post that has translated language versions. WooCommerce product reviews are never included; they already share one review pool across languages." -> "Avst\u00e4ngd som standard. Denna funktion g\u00f6r AI-leverant\u00f6rsf\u00f6rfr\u00e5gningar \u2014 och kostar den associerade API-kostnaden \u2014 f\u00f6r godk\u00e4nda kommentarer p\u00e5 vilket inl\u00e4gg som helst som har \u00f6versatta spr\u00e5kversioner. WooCommerce produktrecensioner ing\u00e5r aldrig; de delar redan en recensionpool \u00f6ver spr\u00e5k."
[sv_SE] "Translation trigger" -> "\u00d6vers\u00e4ttningstrigger"
[sv_SE] "Manual \u2014 translate only via the Comments screen action" -> "Manuell \u2014 \u00f6vers\u00e4tt endast via \u00e5tg\u00e4rden p\u00e5 kommentarssk\u00e4rmen"
[sv_SE] "Automatic \u2014 translate every comment as soon as it's approved" -> "Automatisk \u2014 \u00f6vers\u00e4tt varje kommentar s\u00e5 snart den \u00e4r godk\u00e4nd"
[sv_SE] "Manual (default) queues nothing automatically \u2014 use the \"Translate missing\" bulk action on the Comments screen on your own schedule. Automatic queues a translation the moment a comment is approved (or arrives already-approved), which can spend API calls on comments a moderator was about to reject if there's a large held-for-moderation backlog." -> "Manuell (standard) k\u00f6ar inget automatiskt \u2014 anv\u00e4nd \u00e5tg\u00e4rden \"\u00d6vers\u00e4tt saknas\" i bulk p\u00e5 kommentarssk\u00e4rmen n\u00e4r det passar dig. Automatisk k\u00f6ar en \u00f6vers\u00e4ttning i det \u00f6gonblick en kommentar godk\u00e4nns (eller redan \u00e4r godk\u00e4nd), vilket kan kosta API-anrop p\u00e5 kommentarer som en moderator var p\u00e5 v\u00e4g att avvisa om det finns en stor m\u00e4ngd som v\u00e4ntar p\u00e5 granskning."
[sv_SE] "Max nested-reply depth" -> "Max djup f\u00f6r n\u00e4stlat svar"
[sv_SE] "How many levels of nested replies \"Translate missing\" will walk and translate in one pass, counting the original top-level comment as level 0. Default 2 covers the original comment plus replies and replies-to-replies. Bounds AI spend on deep threads \u2014 anything nested deeper isn't backfilled until this is raised or a further pass runs." -> "Hur m\u00e5nga niv\u00e5er av n\u00e4stlade svar \"\u00d6vers\u00e4tt saknas\" kommer att g\u00e5 igenom och \u00f6vers\u00e4tta i ett svep, d\u00e4r den ursprungliga kommentarer r\u00e4knas som niv\u00e5 0. Standard 2 omfattar den ursprungliga kommentaren plus svar och svar-p\u00e5-svar. Begr\u00e4nsar AI-kostnader p\u00e5 djupa tr\u00e5dar \u2014 allt som \u00e4r n\u00e4stlat djupare fylls inte i f\u00f6rr\u00e4n detta h\u00f6js eller en ytterligare pass g\u00f6rs."
[sv_SE] "Lang" -> "Spr\u00e5k"
[sv_SE] "Also mirrored to: %s" -> "\u00c4ven speglat till: %s"
[sv_SE] "Filter by language" -> "Filtrera efter spr\u00e5k"
