[sw] plural slot 1: "%d comment translation created." -> "%d tafsiri za maoni zimeundwa."
[sw] plural slot 0: "%d pair could not be translated yet (e.g. a nested reply waiting on its parent, or a language currently in cooldown after repeated failures)." -> "%d vipande haviwezi kutafsiriwa bado (mfano, jibu lililokuwa la ndani linangoja mzazi wake, au lugha ambayo kwa sasa iko katika kupumzika baada ya kushindwa mara nyingi)."
[sw] plural slot 1: "%d pair could not be translated yet (e.g. a nested reply waiting on its parent, or a language currently in cooldown after repeated failures)." -> "%d vipande haviwezi kutafsiriwa bado (mfano, majibu yaliyo ndani yanayoangoja mzazi wao, au lugha ambayo kwa sasa iko katika kupumzika baada ya kushindwa mara nyingi)."
[sw] "Comment Translation" -> "Tafsiri ya Maoni"
[sw] "Mirrors an approved comment onto every language version of the post it belongs to, translated, as a real comment on each sibling page. Off by default." -> "Inakidhi maoni yaliyoidhinishwa kwenye kila toleo la lugha la chapisho linalohusiana, likiwa limewekwa kama maoni halisi kwenye kila ukurasa wa ndugu. Imezimwa kwa asili."
[sw] "Comment translation" -> "Tafsiri ya maoni"
[sw] "Enable comment translation" -> "Wezesha tafsiri ya maoni"
[sw] "Off by default. This feature makes AI provider requests \u2014 and spends the associated API cost \u2014 for approved comments on any post that has translated language versions. WooCommerce product reviews are never included; they already share one review pool across languages." -> "Imezimwa kwa asili. Kipengele hiki kinafanya maombi kwa mtoa huduma wa AI \u2014 na kinatumia gharama ya API inayohusiana \u2014 kwa maoni yaliyoidhinishwa kwenye chapisho lolote linalokuwa na matoleo ya lugha yaliyotafsiriwa. Mapitio ya bidhaa za WooCommerce hayatashirikishwa kamwe; tayari yanashiriki kikundi kimoja cha mapitio kati ya lugha."
[sw] "Translation trigger" -> "Kichocheo cha tafsiri"
[sw] "Manual \u2014 translate only via the Comments screen action" -> "Mkononi \u2014 tafsiri tu kupitia hatua ya skrini ya Maoni"
[sw] "Automatic \u2014 translate every comment as soon as it's approved" -> "Automa \u2014 tafsiri kila maoni mara tu yanapothibitishwa"
[sw] "Manual (default) queues nothing automatically \u2014 use the \"Translate missing\" bulk action on the Comments screen on your own schedule. Automatic queues a translation the moment a comment is approved (or arrives already-approved), which can spend API calls on comments a moderator was about to reject if there's a large held-for-moderation backlog." -> "Mkononi (kiwandani) haipangi chochote kiotomatiki \u2014 tumia hatua ya wingi \"Tafsiri zipunguzwe\" kwenye skrini ya Maoni kwa ratiba yako mwenyewe. Automa hupanga tafsiri mara tu maoni yanapothibitishwa (au kuwasili tayari yameidhinishwa), ambayo inaweza kutumia wito za API kwenye maoni ambayo mdhibiti alikuwa karibu kuyakataa ikiwa kuna uhifadhi mkubwa wa maoni yanayosubiri kudhibitiwa."
[sw] "Max nested-reply depth" -> "Max kina cha jibu lililo ndani"
[sw] "How many levels of nested replies \"Translate missing\" will walk and translate in one pass, counting the original top-level comment as level 0. Default 2 covers the original comment plus replies and replies-to-replies. Bounds AI spend on deep threads \u2014 anything nested deeper isn't backfilled until this is raised or a further pass runs." -> "Ni viwango vingapi vya majibu yaliyo ndani \"Tafsiri zipunguzwe\" vitaenda na kutafsiri kwa mpito mmoja, ikihesabu maoni ya awali kama kiwango 0. Kiwango cha 2 kinashughulikia maoni ya asili pamoja na majibu na majibu kwa majibu. Inapunguza matumizi ya AI kwenye nyuzi za kina \u2014 chochote kilicho ndani zaidi hakitawezeshwa hadi hii ipandishwe au kupita zaidi kufanywa."
